{"title":"October Recital!","startsAt":"2026-10-25T17:30:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-25T19:30:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"To sign up to play, please post a comment on the meetup, reserving your spot. You attend, simply RSVP to the meetup\n\nThe time limit for each performer is 7 minutes. Please shorten your piece if it exceeds 7 minutes so everyone will have time to play\n\n======= COST ======\n\nWe use GoFundMe as a vehicle to collect donations for our costs\n\n[https://gofund.me/4ee1b73](https://gofund.me/4ee1b739)\n\nExpand the \"description\" to view an exact breakdown of costs, collected donations, and the current goal. Any additional donations above the goal will be carried forward to the next recitals\n\nGenerally, performers donate a suggested donation of $20 and attendees donate what they can\n\n======= SCHEDULE ======\n\n1 Prasa\n2 Vincent\n3 Gairus\n4 Cole\n5 Chris H\n6 Roberte\n7 Fernando\n8\n9\n10 Fabian\n11 Ken L\n12 Anthony\n13\n14\n15 Dunie\n.\nWaiting list","venue":{"name":"The Array Space","address":"155 Walnut Avenue M6J 3W3, Toronto","lat":43.644238,"lng":-79.41005,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Toronto Amateur Pianist Recital","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/7/9/9/c/highres_448771132.jpeg"}